  - Key: presentationview.confirmlifecycle.reset.explanation.body.dialogue.drafts.evidence.and.linked.dialogue.drafts.evidence.and.linked.retry
    English: Dialogue, drafts, evidence and linked retry data will be cleared. Pending
      replies cannot change the new attempt. Anonymous presentation settings remain
