  - Key: presentationview.confirmlifecycle.reset.explanation.body.your.original.history.and.actual.your.original.history.and.actual.assistance
    English: Your original history and actual assistance remain read-only. Current
      marks, approvals, drafts and pending responses do not become new results. This
