  - Key: presentersurfacebridge.displaydisclosure.return.authored.synthetic.enactment.through.the.authored.synthetic.enactment.through.the.command
    English: Authored synthetic enactment through the {receipt_authority} command
      route. No learner action or evidence.
  - Key: presentersurfacebridge.showpresenterbrief.presenter.disclosure.body.this.run.operates.the.same.movement
    English: This run operates the same movement, native fields, previews and commands
      as manual practice. Its repair, marks, findings and role decisions are authored
      demonstration content, never your work or learner evidence. No AI or live service
      is connected.
  - Key: presentersurfacebridge.showpresenterbrief.presenter.disclosure.heading.synthetic.authored.and.offline
    English: Synthetic, authored and offline
  - Key: presentersurfacebridge.showpresenterbrief.presenter.handback.body.the.walkthrough.uses.a.fresh.isolated
    English: The walkthrough uses a fresh isolated Presenter session. Returning restores
      your own session, drafts and prior workspace. Direct routes preserve the same
      decisions and receipts.
  - Key: presentersurfacebridge.showpresenterbrief.presenter.handback.heading.your.current.local.work.is.preserved
    English: Your current local work is preserved
  - Key: presentersurfacebridge.showpresenterbrief.presenter.pacing.body.the.source.presentation.target.is.90
    English: The source presentation target is 90 seconds. Full progressive typing,
      readable replies and campus travel take longer. Pace and dwell are editable
      in the saved Walkthrough asset. Pause, return to your practice, restart and
      exit remain available throughout.
  - Key: presentersurfacebridge.showpresenterbrief.presenter.pacing.heading.full.visible.causal.sequence
