  - Key: receipt.accepted.body
    English: The operational request for {pair} was accepted. No additional semantic
      or competence claim is implied.
  - Key: receipt.accepted.heading
    English: Request recorded
  - Key: receipt.attention
    English: Request needs attention
  - Key: receipt.hold.accept.body
    English: The response concerns {pair}. Inspect the actual hold state and its
      owner, time and next action. A hold is not publication approval.
  - Key: receipt.hold.owner.heading
    English: Owner response recorded
  - Key: receipt.hold.request.body
    English: The hold proposal for {pair} was recorded. Owner acceptance is still
      separate. Publication has not been approved.
  - Key: receipt.hold.request.heading
    English: Hold proposed
  - Key: receipt.hold.self.heading
    English: Your commitment recorded
  - Key: receipt.hold.time.future
    English: Choose a hold review time later than the current logical time. Your
      draft is retained.
  - Key: receipt.pair.mismatch
    English: This request refers to a different task or rubric version. The original
      request is for {pair}. Your draft is retained.
  - Key: receipt.rejected
    English: The request for {pair} was not accepted. Your draft and original request
      are retained. Inspect the exact receipt details before creating a fresh preview.
  - Key: receipt.release.body
    English: Publication was accepted for the exact approved {pair}. This release
      is retained in the read-only history.
  - Key: receipt.release.different.approval
    English: Release was not accepted for {pair}. The recorded approval covers {approved_pair}.
      Obtain a separate review of the exact current pair before release.
  - Key: receipt.release.heading
    English: Release recorded
  - Key: receipt.release.no.approval
    English: Release was not accepted for {pair}. No exact current approval is recorded.
  - Key: receipt.review.approved.heading
    English: Requested pair approved
  - Key: receipt.review.decision.body
    English: 'This decision applies to {pair}.

      {reason}'
  - Key: receipt.review.request.body
    English: Your review request for {pair} was recorded. A time slot and a review
      decision are separate responses. No approval has been granted.
  - Key: receipt.review.request.heading
    English: Review requested
  - Key: receipt.review.returned.heading
    English: Requested pair returned
  - Key: receipt.review.summary.required
    English: Add your change summary before requesting review. Your draft is retained.
  - Key: receipt.review.time.window
    English: Choose a review time from 13:40 to 14:00, no earlier than the current
      logical time. Your draft is retained.
  - Key: receipt.schedule.accepted.body
    English: The review of {pair} is scheduled for {time}. Scheduling grants no publication
      approval.
  - Key: receipt.schedule.accepted.heading
    English: Review time accepted
  - Key: receipt.schedule.denied.body
    English: The requested slot for {pair} was declined. No time slot or approval
      was recorded.
  - Key: receipt.schedule.denied.heading
    English: Review time declined
  - Key: receipt.schedule.unavailable.body
    English: A review slot for {pair} was unavailable. No time slot or approval was
      recorded.
  - Key: receipt.schedule.unavailable.heading
    English: Review time unavailable
  - Key: receipt.unresolved
    English: Request outcome unresolved
  - Key: receipt.unresolved.body
    English: The outcome for {pair} is not confirmed. Keep the original request and
      inspect its details before retrying.
  - Key: record.recorded
    English: Recorded
  - Key: review.approved.body
    English: This exact current pair has an approval. Preview release to submit the
      separate publication request.
  - Key: review.denied.body
    English: The review request was declined. No time slot or approval was recorded.
  - Key: review.held.body
    English: The work is held with an accepted owner, review time and next action.
      The defect remains unresolved. Publication is closed.
  - Key: review.hold.requested.body
    English: A hold has been proposed. Inspect the actual owner response or confirm
      your own commitment. No acceptance or publication approval is inferred.
  - Key: review.packet.interrupted
    English: Handling stopped; requests retained.
  - Key: review.packet.reduced
    English: Recorded request; motion reduced.
  - Key: review.pending.body
    English: The current pair has been requested for review. A slot is not yet accepted
      and no approval is recorded.
  - Key: review.released.body
    English: Release is recorded for this exact current pair. Its approval and release
      receipts remain in the read-only history.
  - Key: review.returned.body
    English: The requested pair was returned. Read the actual reason, revise the
      documents and request a review of the new exact pair.
  - Key: review.scheduled.body
    English: A review time is accepted for the current pair. The review decision
      is separate. No publication approval is recorded.
  - Key: review.self.hold.body
    English: Your self-owned commitment is recorded. The stated defect remains unverified.
      This is not an NPC acceptance or publication approval.
  - Key: review.stale.approval.body
    English: The approval covers {approved_pair}. The current {current_pair} requires
      a separate review before release.
  - Key: review.stale.body
    English: The current documents need a new exact-pair review. Earlier review records
      remain in history.
  - Key: review.unavailable.body
    English: A review response is unavailable. The original request is retained.
      No approval is inferred.
  - Key: review.unknown.body
    English: The review outcome is not confirmed. Inspect the original request and
      receipt before retrying.
  - Key: review.unrequested.body
    English: Request a review of the exact current task and rubric. Scheduling, review
      decisions and release are separate actions.
